diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..9f75d54
--- /dev/null
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -0,0 +1,14 @@
+## 0.5.3-openauto-cancel.1 – 2026-10-14
+
+Cancel Android synthesis without leaving the previous request running.
+
+- Keep synthesis on Android's synthesis thread until all callback work completes.
+- Track cancellation during model loading and before native stream publication.
+- Serialize native stream publication/cancellation/removal to prevent stale-pointer access.
+- Protect native handle lifetime across synthesis, stop and close.
+- Release the native lifetime lock before deleting the engine that owns its mutex.
+- Install debug builds under a separate application ID for comparison with upstream 0.5.3.
+- Keep Android path-security tests valid on Windows using the JDK's Unix-style ZIP filesystem.
+- Avoid downloading unused dr_libs test submodules with paths too long for Windows.
+
+This is a local evaluation build, not an upstream Pocket TTS release.
